cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "cortec-framework: reference implementations of CoRTeC"
message: "Cite the paper (Calyie/cortec) for the method; cite this repository for the software."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-24"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Calyie/cortec-framework"
abstract: >-
  Two Apache-2.0 packages implementing CoRTeC, cohort-conditioned differentially private synthetic
  tabular data from a frozen language model, with every guarantee the paper establishes enforced in
  code: capability gating, hash-locked prompts, an auditable privacy ledger, a per-column coverage
  guard, and a model-free hybrid that relabels an existing DP synthesiser's output.
authors:
  - family-names: "Nnona"
    given-names: "Calister"
    email: "calisternnona@gmail.com"
references:
  - type: article
    title: "CoRTeC: Cohort-Conditioned Differentially Private Synthetic Tabular Data from a Frozen Language Model"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/Calyie/cortec"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Nnona"
        given-names: "Calister"
